{"id":"df8e5b5b4dea8723","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-ideal-on-poset.md","title":"ZFC Ideal On Poset","display":"df-zfc-ideal-on-poset — ZFC Ideal On Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-on-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-on-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-on-poset — ZFC Ideal On Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-directed.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-on-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-on-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-on-poset — ZFC Ideal On Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" href=\"?note=1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-directed.md\">../batch14/58-df-directed.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (poset carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (partial order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq P\">\\(I\\subseteq P\\)</span> (candidate order ideal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\)</span> (directed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" href=\"?note=1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-directed.md\">../batch14/58-df-directed.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderIdeal}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrderIdeal}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrderIdeal}(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land I\\subseteq P\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\bigl(I,\\leq_P\\cap(I\\times I)\\bigr)\\land\\forall p\\in I\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(q\\leq_P p\\to q\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrderIdeal}(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land I\\subseteq P\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\bigl(I,\\leq_P\\cap(I\\times I)\\bigr)\\land\\forall p\\in I\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(q\\leq_P p\\to q\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directedness supplies the previously missing nonemptiness condition as well as finite upper bounds inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>. The order argument is restricted to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\times I\">\\(I\\times I\\)</span>, as required by the exact signature of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-directed.md","status":"resolved","id":"1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-directed.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-directed.md","status":"resolved","id":"1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Directed}_S$ (directed-set predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-directed.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrderIdeal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrderIdeal}(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land I\\subseteq P\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\bigl(I,\\leq_P\\cap(I\\times I)\\bigr)\\land\\forall p\\in I\\;\\forall q\\in P\\;(q\\leq_P p\\to q\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1201,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-ideal-on-poset.md|58-df-zfc-ideal-on-poset]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","1fc4c0c7a21cd8c1"]}